WEBVTT

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.260
Okay, take two!
And... ACTION!

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.220
That's what it's starting
to feel like around here...

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:42.320
...as we compete to find
the final Darkstar weapon!

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.160
Keeping ahead of us
are Erulogos and Sirius...

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:48.130
...two of Almayce's buddies.

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:50.600
With guys that
powerful attacking us...

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:54.200
...things were pretty
tight there for a while.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.000
I wonder what's gonna
happen in this fight.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.770
We just need
the last weapon now...

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.210
...so I wish it'd make
an appearance already!

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:05.080
If it doesn't, I'm REALLY
gonna cause some trouble!

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:44.290
The whole world looks silver
as far as the eye can see!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.720
Is the final weapon
really here?

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.390
Gimme a break!

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:54.830
I'm not built to be cold,
tired, and hungry like this!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.890
Then I guess you follow your
basic instincts a lot, don't you?

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:06.650
No doubt about it...

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:09.580
The final weapon is
definitely up ahead.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.950
And you're absolutely
sure about this, right?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.450
We won't get anywhere just standing
around complaining, Miss Lina!

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:18.850
Exactly. If the final weapon
falls into our enemies' hands...

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.050
...how hot or cold it is
won't really matter!

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:25.060
Into our enemies' hands...
Those guys said they were...

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:28.100
...gathering the five
weapons to kill Darkstar...

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.430
...but is that really
their objective?

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.260
I wouldn't count on it.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:36.040
We've seen that guy Erulogos
is willing to destroy...

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:40.170
...entire cities in this world
in order to get the final weapon.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.970
All they are now are a
bunch of destroyers!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.370
All we can do now is get
the weapon before they do...

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.350
...and then see what they try.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.500
What in the world?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.990
At this rate, it's only a question
of time before the gateway reopens.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.860
They've found it? Let's go!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.500
Wait.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:17.570
You'll destroy even more cities,
kill even more people now?

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:22.710
If the gate reopens, this world
will suffer much worse than that.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.210
Why do you put such trifles
before the greater task at hand?

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:30.550
I thought the plan was to minimize
our interference in this world...

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.680
...in order to kill Darkstar.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.020
The situation has already changed.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:41.030
Don't forget that our world teeters
on the brink of annihilation.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:47.760
Or would you have us abandon
our world to save this one?

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.570
The servants of Volphied
have indeed fallen far.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:56.610
In any case, our greatest
nuisances, Lina and the others...

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.620
...have gotten ahead of us.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:02.750
I think we can agree getting
the final weapon comes first.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.680
What do you think?

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.640
Cold! Cold! Cold! Cold!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.680
Gimme a break!
Gimme a break! Gimme a break!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:27.410
Gonna die! Gonna die! Gonna die!
Gimme something hot to eat!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:03.040
Really quiet, isn't it?

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:05.170
Although I can't see
why anyone would...

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.280
...build a temple in the
middle of an ice field!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.180
Don't be so short-sighted.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:12.120
Humans aren't the only
"people" in this world.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:14.090
There are penguins and
ghosts and fish and...

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.660
Well, ghosts I could
believe in this place.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.260
I just hope we finally
start getting some answers.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:21.600
Miss Lina?!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.530
What happened, Lina?!

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.340
Filia!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:37.680
A barrier. This temple has
some sort of ward on it.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:41.780
It's been sealed!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.860
A barrier created by
the Dragon race...

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:55.790
It's definitely been magically
restricted by the golden dragons!

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.800
Restricted?

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.300
The magical crests
dotted across the land...

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.310
...generate a barrier
at their exact center.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.340
And you're saying
that's this place here?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:08.070
Yes. But I never thought...

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.340
I never knew our race
had built a temple...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.210
...this far out on the frontier.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.800
You didn't know
about this, Miss Filia?

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.030
Right.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.600
A priestess of the Fire Dragon King...

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.300
...should know how to break a
sealing barrier, right, Filia?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.310
Yes, but...

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:41.640
Don't tell me you want to go back to
the temple of the Fire Dragon King...

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:44.180
...and ask the Supreme
Elder's permission!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:49.420
I wasn't suggesting that at all!
It's just that I... Just!

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.490
We can't turn away now.
Do it, Filia!

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:56.860
That's right... This is
no time to be distracted.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.430
Why is Miss Filia so hesitant?

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.730
Not bad! All right!
That was great, Filia!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.200
Hey! Wait for me!

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.650
It seems one of our tasks
has been done for us.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.650
What is this place?

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:26.310
Filia?!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.720
Miss Filia!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.990
Filia!

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.080
What is all this?!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.690
It's horrible...

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.540
Look! Another barrier's still
being cast further in!

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:39.040
Why would someone go to this much
trouble to seal off a temple?

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.210
What is this place?!

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.880
Miss Filia?

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:47.510
It has to be...
This is... This place...

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.320
A temple of the Ancient Dragons!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.760
Temple of the Ancient
Dragons? Valgaav's people?

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:09.510
You who carry the
blood of the golden dragons...

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.600
Our ancient enemies...

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.710
Answer us, servant
of the Fire Dragon King.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.620
You, who murdered our race.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:23.350
Who hid our remains
in this land of ice.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:27.990
Why have you come
to disturb our grave?

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:30.830
You, who became murderers
in the name of the gods!

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:32.260
Murderers?!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:36.690
Our race lives to reform
those who would prevent peace!

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.760
There's no way we could
have been murderers!

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:46.900
Those who would
prevent peace?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.510
Is not participating
in a war "evil"?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:55.950
And using your might to kill those
who disagree with you is "just"?

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:59.890
Look well at the truth which
time's passage has buried.

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:07.390
With the loss of
the Water Dragon King...

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.530
...in the War of the
Monsters' Fall...

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:14.730
...the Dragon race desired a new
power to oppose the Monster race.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.870
That power lay with
the one dragon tribe...

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:21.070
...who did not
participate in the war:

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:24.210
We, the Ancient Dragons.

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:28.510
We felt that our joining
the battle would only lead...

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:31.890
...to the use of a weapon
too powerful to ever be used.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:35.550
We feared the balance of
this world would be upset.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.830
New power would only
give rise to new destruction.

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:46.460
And so we sealed
away this new threat.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.470
Even now, we ask the question:

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:53.310
Why can peace not be
attained by not fighting...

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:56.410
...and instead quietly
accepting fate?

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.280
But despite having
sealed it away...

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.080
...it was clear
we Ancient Dragons...

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.750
...still possessed the power
to threaten the world.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:10.420
The fear we would
someday unleash it...

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.400
...grew to unstoppable strength.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:19.230
And the result was that those who
guaranteed the "peace" of the world...

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:22.370
...ordered our annihilation.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:29.240
Look for yourself at what they
did in the name of"justice"!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:33.270
And then answer our question!

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:18.930
Valgaav...

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:33.800
Answer our question!
Answer our question!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.090
What... What was?

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.630
If what they said was true...

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.000
Then, inside this temple...

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.590
...the Ancient Dragons hid
a powerful weapon they found.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:58.360
Miss Lina, we have to do
something for Miss Filia!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.710
This may sound cruel...

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.070
...but this is something she
has to deal with herself.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.980
The path of light sent out
by the other four weapons...

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:16.250
...leads to an area hidden deep
inside golden dragon territory.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:18.450
It's quite ironic, actually.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.690
The sentiment is meaningless.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.850
Well, as long as you give us
a bit of Lord Darkstar's power...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.870
...to aid us in resurrecting
our Dark Lord Shabranigdo...

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.060
...I'll be happy to help you.

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:32.390
Typical of the Monster race.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.100
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:44.120
Only a dragon can break
a dragon barrier.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:45.280
Filia!

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:50.250
Right now... Let's just think
about getting the final weapon.

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.150
Miss Filia...

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:58.850
That's right. Finding the
final weapon comes first.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:02.300
But because of
that weapon, my people!

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:05.430
I will not be defeated by you.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:10.410
Have I? Have we been
doing the right thing?

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.110
Hey, Lina...
Can I ask you one thing?

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:21.850
What?!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.350
Who are the real bad
guys in all of this?

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:27.930
Well...

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:00.020
The truth behind
everything is hidden in here.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.880
It's them! Is the barrier?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:54.710
Not yet!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.440
Cover Filia! We have
to stop those guys!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:05.290
I have to get it!
I have to find my answer!

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:14.190
Even I cannot breach
a barrier of the Gods.

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:18.930
You're certainly proving
yourself useful, Filia.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:23.030
Xellos... What are you
doing here by yourself?

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:25.130
Well, well, Almayce...

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.910
Shouldn't you be
watching the gateway?

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:29.940
What's the point if you're
just trying to cheat me?

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:31.370
Oh?

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.580
All that's left now is
to get the final weapon.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.590
Correct?

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:40.350
I doubt you'll sit
quietly by and help Erulogos.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:43.620
Damn you...
What are you up to?

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:46.360
- Up to? I'm just...
- Just what?

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.930
Oh, that, of course...

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.090
...is a secret.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.910
Only one more barrier
left to break...

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:10.460
So, it's them.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:11.490
Time to fight.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.150
Leave the hand-to-hand
stuff to me.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:17.630
Don't make light of them. The girl
Lina can call upon the power of chaos.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.140
- What's that?!
- Golden dragons!

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:51.560
So, you've made it this far, Filia.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:54.300
Supreme Elder!

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:22.980
Gods, Monsters, and Overworlders!

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.610
I don't know what
they're planning...

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:27.320
...but that final weapon's
MI NE, you hear me?!

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:29.020
Next time: " Eternal Death,
Final Farewells!"

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:30.530
"A Cry to the Fallen!"

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:33.720
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
